### ====================================================
### AI Provider Switching Tests (OpenAI / Claude)
### ====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1) OpenAI connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2) Claude connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/claude
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3) Switch to OpenAI explicitly
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/provider?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4) Switch to Claude explicitly
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/provider?provider=claude
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5) Use configured default provider (app.ai.provider)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
